{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "97a4421c02a0b049d384df8ededebd14aeb1d461af1555459096e20151ba68c8", "ja": "（午前中の仕事がキリよく終わりそうだ。\nこれなら、昼休みは少し長めにとれるかな？）", "zh": "（上午的工作差不多要告一段落了。这样的话，午休时间可以稍微长一点吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd788c6bba7a0c3d7b405c66040e60ae72fd2c7448d8d97a30ecb4a1bd9e4209", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nこっちにいたんですね、探してしまいました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦您了～。\n原来您在这边啊，我找您好久了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0352bc2efd06fff290186b318ea08f6d52abcdbc3bbf719b9ee54d7151bb6a53", "ja": "お疲れ様、美也。けどどうしたんだ？\n今日は確か、オフだったと思うけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。不过，怎么了？\n我记得你今天应该休息吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "6c43dc33b1b80f5cd054bf6cdd5dba6a0ca09a958def891a6cbf06e409b4a998", "ja": "はい～。実は、エレナさんとお買い物の\n約束をしていて、劇場で待ち合わせなんです～。", "zh": "是的～其实我和艾莲娜小姐约好了去买东西，要在剧场碰面～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "66eb632b143ceeec73b89dec133bae7d52cfea69c3d3a7fd40d7e191e568caa2", "ja": "新しい服を着てきたので、お披露目にきました～。\nどうですか～？　似合っていますか～？", "zh": "我穿了新衣服过来，想给大家看看～  \n怎么样～？适合我吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7b7d5a9fed33be95090a172989f92891a5e24430a3faa971c0be8962e4a9e8f6", "ja": "ああ、お嬢様っぽい雰囲気の服だな。\n美也によく似合ってるよ！", "zh": "啊，这身衣服很有大小姐的感觉。\n很适合美也哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "53928e63a2a37386dc930be9ff65a93d09654b2896ee44b30ade5914d63b1939", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\n気合いを入れて選んだかいがありました～♪", "zh": "谢谢您～真是没白费我鼓足干劲挑了这么久～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c85e23a46d846c7ee6e26180df97b035efbd6817786b9887416e1a6e7a1d6979", "ja": "うん、楽しんできてくれ。\n……それにしても、エレナが来ないな？", "zh": "嗯，去好好享受吧。\n……话说回来，艾蕾娜怎么还没来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "163c997eb70ca004db186787c41d4f966b6fc6140ce6071ee48f410eedfe6b39", "ja": "そうですね～。\n約束の時間は、とっくに過ぎているのですが……。", "zh": "是呀～  \n约定的时间早就过了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "14eae5c389a57c90a80617eecbb725e49df8282db887cdcf8bea8757303942cc", "ja": "エレナさん、何かあったんでしょうか～。\n心配なので、メッセージを送ってみますね～。", "zh": "艾丽娜，不知道是不是发生什么事了～  \n我有点担心，先给她发条消息吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "6597e83db8148d4c3e39c9a79805807405d60da1cc26485d74b7753d1039545e", "ja": "……なんと～。\nお買い物の約束、来週だったみたいです～。", "zh": "……哎呀～。\n买东西的约定，好像是下周呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1011_p", "source_sha256": "15e437f5319c647d505d9e291317542e2d39cc611afbb904dda1f99fc92c5ee0", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。\nつまり、日付けを間違えた……？", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。\n也就是说，是把日期搞错了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "8faed516d1532727292b3337fba6544821aa1150c717f84c2a2f52ee9de7ddd4", "ja": "はい～。エレナさんを、\nびっくりさせてしまいましたよ～。", "zh": "是的～。结果让艾蕾娜小姐吓了一跳呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "b185e59c04c2dd6604452d78a7ee89497d7d177c0973c5000a8dd37f59b306c9", "ja": "お出かけが楽しみだったので、気持ちが\n急いでしまったのかもしれません～。", "zh": "因为太期待出门了，心情可能也跟着急切起来了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "de972d6cb43726b54495a9c6030cfa5b8e2c3c1195f4e2f7a086d3c806a649db", "ja": "そうか。まあ、勘違いなんて誰にでもあるから……\nエレナも、気にしてなかったろ？", "zh": "这样啊。嗯，谁都会有误会……艾蕾娜也没放在心上吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "1c43fc11a575b9e986d30c7ab713e19653b36100168450f647f856fa6b2d3c89", "ja": "はい～。今日は用事があるそうで、エレナさんとは\n来週改めて、お買い物に行きます～。", "zh": "是的～。听说今天有事，所以和艾蕾娜小姐改到下周再一起去买东西～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1016_p", "source_sha256": "85d9e5e20f99aa911598e6ddfea1a2c8853348548c809379e3fa547a0a834405", "ja": "せっかくおめかししてるのに、すぐ帰るのもな……。\n美也さえ良ければ、この後お昼でも食べに行こうか？", "zh": "难得特意打扮了一番，就这么马上回去也不太好……如果美也愿意的话，接下来一起去吃个午饭怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "87147741f2402657c6ca70abc321a7f1bed2e9f988def32bbcc74e092cc5b43f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……いいんですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "439e98a2eba17822655192d8ed822bba630b6eed0f6903b1cde7e768f061c5f8", "ja": "うん。もうすぐ昼休憩だしな。\n少しだけ、待っててもらうことになるけど……。", "zh": "嗯。反正马上就到午休时间了。\n虽然得让你稍微等一下就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f2e1695cad4cb3c5c3ea9566f44eb165f1170eae8fae136db4ee2bb87e6ac4c", "ja": "わかりました～。日にちは間違えてしまいましたけど、\nなんだか得した気分ですな～。ふふふ。", "zh": "明白啦～虽然把日期记错了，\n但总觉得好像赚到了呢～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a13c91c71c419bef4eae1f146ac097c0f8c47212895154afdad95a091656a3a3", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nそれじゃ、少し待っててくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。\n那就请稍微等一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "dc3204ff69be07582a7e8bb23a770005058fa581621486eca1fa329e6f8753c3", "ja": "はい～。{$P$}さんも、\nお仕事、がんばってくださいね～。", "zh": "好的～。{$P$}先生也请加油工作哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0434_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4ceae91c2f35e15723ba513a3936b715efa42afab6756bb940531d34c42c971d", "ja": "（美也のオシャレが無駄にならなくてよかった。\n待たせすぎないよう、急いで仕事を片付けるか！）", "zh": "（幸好美也精心打扮的造型没有白费。\n得赶紧把工作处理完，别让她等太久了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
